WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:08.630
TWL is back… kinda… and not here.

00:00:08.630 --> 00:00:13.280
As of today, there’s a brand new channel
by Wendover Productions and its called Half

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:14.290
as Interesting.

00:00:14.290 --> 00:00:18.130
The videos are about half as long and probably
about half as good as the ones here.

00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:22.490
It’s essentially the continuation of the
old TWL series without the restriction of

00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:24.770
only picking topics from that wikipedia list.

00:00:24.770 --> 00:00:29.470
There’s no more waiting because the first
video is up now and it’s about what’s

00:00:29.470 --> 00:00:32.300
the longest continuous drivable distance on
earth.

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:37.000
Videos will be going up there weekly every
Thursday at 10:30 am eastern.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:41.280
Wendover Productions will remain just as it
always has, the only difference is that you

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:44.899
can listen to more and more of this voice
over there.

00:00:44.899 --> 00:00:48.162
I’d really appreciate it if you go over
there are subscribe to at least give it a

00:00:48.162 --> 00:00:49.540
try for a few episodes.

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:54.079
I’ve been putting a lot of work into developing
that channel and hopefully it will end up

00:00:54.079 --> 00:00:55.280
being something great.

